export anchor Pixel8BitStyle:
    number: 29
    screen: SignIn
    name: Pixel 8-bit
    idea: A light 8-bit title screen where every box is drawn in 4px pixel steps, the type is chunky monospace caps, and signing in feels like pressing start.
    base: light
    palette:
        sky: #cfe8ff, the page background
        panel: #fffdf5, the menu panel and the style sheet
        cloud: #ffffff, fields, secondary buttons and the pixel clouds
        ink: #1a1c2c, text, every pixel outline and the 1P tag
        dim: #4a4e69, the Player 1 line and secondary text
        startRed: #b4202a, the primary button and the error text and badge
        linkBlue: #29539b, links with a 4px underline bar
        coin: #ffcd75, the hard shadow under the brand, the Show key and the focus bar
        grass: #38b764, the decorative ground strip
        soil: #8a5a2b, the decorative brick ground with #9c6a37 bricks
    type:
        Courier New, Courier, ui-monospace, DejaVu Sans Mono, Menlo,
        Consolas, monospace, always bold. The brand is 40px weight 900
        uppercase with 0.06em tracking and a hard 4px coin shadow. The
        heading is 20px uppercase. Buttons are 15px uppercase with 0.06em
        tracking. Field text is 16px, body and errors 14px, and labels 12
        to 13px uppercase with 0.1em tracking.
    layout:
        A centred title screen on a pale sky. Two pixel clouds float at the
        top corners, then a pixel sun logo beside the brand and the line
        Player 1 · ready. A single panel 440px wide holds a 1P tag with the
        heading, two full width sign-in buttons, a dashed or divider, the
        fields, the checkbox row, the red start button with a play arrow and
        the create account line. Privacy and Terms sit below the panel, and
        a grass and brick ground strip runs along the bottom. At 375px the
        clouds hide and the panel fills the width.
    spacing: A 4px pixel grid. 16 to 20px between controls and 28px panel padding.
    density: Low. One panel, big targets and lots of sky.
    corners: Notched pixel corners from four flat 4px box-shadows with no blur, so each box loses one pixel at every corner.
    borders: 4px ink pixel outlines on every box. Buttons add a 4px inner bevel, lighter top left and darker bottom right. Dividers are 8px ink dashes 4px thick.
    shadows: No soft shadows. Only the hard 4px coin shadow under the brand.
    icons:
        Pixel art drawn in SVG with crisp edges. A pixel sun logo, square
        letter keys G and M on the sign-in buttons, a square badge with an
        exclamation mark on the error, an X in the square checkbox, and a
        play arrow on the start button and on a focused list row.
    focus: A 4px dashed ink outline offset 8px. Buttons and rows also get a 4px coin bar along the bottom, and a focused field gets an 8px coin halo outside its pixel outline.
    tone: Game menu words, short and upbeat, such as Player 1 · ready and a 1P tag. Labels and buttons are uppercase.
